  "Rhone": {
   "note": "Correct river course Vienne to Avignon and correct banks - Cote-Rotie, Condrieu, Saint-Joseph, Cornas and Saint-Peray on the right (west) bank, Hermitage and Crozes-Hermitage on the left (east) bank at Tain, Chateauneuf-du-Pape, Gigondas and Vacqueyras east of the river and Tavel and Lirac west of it - but longitudes are stretched about twice relative to latitudes to fill the square grid, so the northern gorge looks far wider than it is, and appellation outlines are simplified blobs rather than surveyed boundaries.",
